"Plan output includes too many write actions for one Core intake request."
msgstr "计划输出包含的写入动作超出单次 Core 接入请求的上限。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:228
msgid ""
"Article batch write plans must declare "
"artifact_type=article_batch_write_plan."
msgstr "文章批量写入计划必须声明 artifact_type=article_batch_write_plan。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:236
msgid ""
"Article batch write plans must explicitly request batch proposal approval."
msgstr "文章批量写入计划必须明确请求批量提案批准。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:245
msgid ""
"Article batch write plans must contain a bounded group of draft actions."
msgstr "文章批量写入计划必须包含有界的草稿操作组。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:257
msgid ""
"Article batch write plans must include one reviewed article artifact set per "
"draft action."
msgstr "文章批量写入计划必须为每个草稿操作包含一组已审核文章工件。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:266
msgid "Article batch entries must be objects."
msgstr "文章批量条目必须是对象。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:283
msgid "Article batch write actions must be objects."
msgstr "文章批量写入操作必须是对象。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:310
msgid ""
"Article media batch write plans must declare "
"artifact_type=article_media_batch_write_plan."
msgstr ""
"文章媒体批量写入计划必须声明 artifact_type=article_media_batch_write_plan。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:318
msgid ""
"Article media batch write plans must explicitly request batch proposal "
"approval."
msgstr "文章媒体批量写入计划必须明确请求批量提案批准。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:327
msgid "Article media batch write plans must include 1 to 5 reviewed articles."
msgstr "文章媒体批量写入计划必须包含 1 到 5 篇已审核文章。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:339
msgid "Article media batch entries must be objects."
msgstr "文章媒体批量条目必须是对象。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:353
msgid ""
"Article media batch entries must preserve the selected image-source "
"candidate."
msgstr "文章媒体批量条目必须保留所选 image-source 候选项。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:366
msgid ""
"Article media batch write plans must contain a bounded group of draft, media "
"upload, and featured-image actions."
msgstr "文章媒体批量写入计划必须包含有界的草稿、媒体上传和特色图片操作组。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:391
msgid "Article media batch write actions must be objects."
msgstr "文章媒体批量写入操作必须是对象。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:403
msgid ""
"Article media batch plans may target only draft and allowlisted media "
"actions."
msgstr "文章媒体批量计划只能面向草稿和允许列表中的媒体操作。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:425
msgid ""
"Article media batch plans must include create, upload, and featured-image "
"actions for every article."
msgstr "文章媒体批量计划必须为每篇文章包含创建、上传和特色图片操作。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:448
msgid ""
"Image candidate adoption plans must declare "
"artifact_type=image_candidate_adoption_plan."
msgstr "图片候选采用计划必须声明 artifact_type=image_candidate_adoption_plan。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:457
msgid ""
"Image candidate adoption plans must preserve a selected image_candidate.v1 "
"candidate."
msgstr "图片候选采用计划必须保留一个所选 image_candidate.v1 候选项。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:466
msgid ""
"Image candidate adoption plans must contain upload, metadata, and optional "
"featured-image actions only."
msgstr "图片候选采用计划只能包含上传、元数据和可选特色图片操作。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:481
msgid "Image candidate adoption actions must be objects."
msgstr "图片候选采用操作必须是对象。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:492
msgid ""
"Image candidate adoption plans may target only media import, metadata, and "
"featured-image abilities."
msgstr "图片候选采用计划只能面向媒体导入、元数据和特色图片能力。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:511
msgid ""
"Image candidate adoption plans must include exactly one media upload and one "
"metadata action, plus at most one featured-image action."
msgstr ""
"图片候选采用计划必须正好包含一个媒体上传和一个元数据操作，并最多包含一个特色"
"图片操作。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:531
msgid ""
"Image candidate adoption action input must remain dry-run and must not "
"request commit."
msgstr "图片候选采用操作输入必须保持试运行，且不得请求提交。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:544
msgid "Image candidate upload actions must include a reviewed candidate URL."
msgstr "图片候选上传操作必须包含已审核的候选 URL。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:555
msgid ""
"Image candidate source_type must be owned, ai_generated, stock, external, or "
"test."
msgstr ""
"图片候选 source_type 必须是 owned、ai_generated、stock、external 或 test。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:569
msgid ""
"Image candidate metadata actions must include attachment_id or an approved "
"output reference."
msgstr "图片候选元数据操作必须包含 attachment_id 或已批准的输出引用。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:583
msgid ""
"Image candidate featured-image actions must include attachment_id or an "
"approved output reference."
msgstr "图片候选特色图片操作必须包含 attachment_id 或已批准的输出引用。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:593
msgid ""
"Image candidate featured-image actions must include post_id or an approved "
"output reference."
msgstr "图片候选特色图片操作必须包含 post_id 或已批准的输出引用。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:616
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review plans must declare "
"artifact_type=site_knowledge_review_plan."
msgstr ""
"Site Knowledge 审阅计划必须声明 artifact_type=site_knowledge_review_plan。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:624
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review plans must not claim direct WordPress write authority."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅计划不得声明直接 WordPress 写入权限。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:633
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review plans must preserve evidence_refs from the Cloud "
"handoff."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅计划必须保留来自 Cloud 交接的 evidence_refs。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:642
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review plans must contain exactly one blocked create-draft "
"review action."
msgstr ""
"Site Knowledge 审阅计划必须且只能包含一个受拦截的 create-draft 审阅动作。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:651
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review plans may target only create-draft as a non-ready "
"review proposal."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅计划只能以 create-draft 生成未就绪的审阅提案。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:659
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review plans must remain not ready until a human supplies the "
"draft fields."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅计划在人工提供草稿字段之前必须保持未就绪。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:669
msgid "Site Knowledge review plans must require human title and content input."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅计划必须要求人工输入标题和内容。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:683
msgid "Site Knowledge review plans may prepare draft proposals only."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅计划只能准备草稿提案。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:691
msgid ""
"Site Knowledge review action input must remain dry-run and must not request "
"commit."
msgstr "Site Knowledge 审阅动作输入必须保持试运行，且不得请求提交。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:710
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans must declare "
"artifact_type=nightly_site_inspection_review_plan."
msgstr ""
"Nightly Inspection 审阅计划必须声明 "
"artifact_type=nightly_site_inspection_review_plan。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:719
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans must use the v1 Core review plan contract."
msgstr "Nightly Inspection 审阅计划必须使用 v1 Core 审阅计划契约。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:727
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans must not claim direct WordPress write "
"authority."
msgstr "Nightly Inspection 审阅计划不得声明直接 WordPress 写入权限。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:736
msgid "Nightly Inspection review plans must preserve Cloud evidence_refs."
msgstr "Nightly Inspection 审阅计划必须保留 Cloud evidence_refs。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:745
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans must preserve the selected Morning Brief "
"review item."
msgstr "Nightly Inspection 审阅计划必须保留选定的 Morning Brief 审阅条目。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:754
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans must contain exactly one blocked create-"
"draft review action."
msgstr ""
"Nightly Inspection 审阅计划必须且只能包含一个受拦截的 create-draft 审阅动作。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:763
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans may target only create-draft as a non-ready "
